## Data Flow (After)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Server
    App->>Server: PUT /api/student/update/embedding (dirty records)
    Server->>Server: replace_for_student() → new rows with updated_at
    Server->>Server: compute embedding_hash
    Server-->>App: 200 OK + items_meta [{id, updated_at, server_hash}]
    App->>App: applyPushMetadata → update Hive + advance watermark
    App->>Server: GET /api/student/export/json?from_date=NEW_WATERMARK
    Server-->>App: [] (empty — no echoed records!)
```

## Safety Guarantees
- **Backward compatible**: `items_meta` is an additive field; old clients ignore it
- **Non-fatal**: `applyPushMetadata` catches all errors — push success is never rolled back
- **UTC handling**: Server always returns timezone-aware ISO-8601; Dart always `.toUtc()`
- **Idempotent**: Re-applying the same metadata is safe (same values overwrite)
